OL,3,GNEWSATrain firms urged by city's MPs to
OL,4,Ago all-electric
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Hull MPs have written to train
OL,7,Fcompanies operating in the area urging
OL,8,Fthem to buy battery-powered trains the
OL,9,Fnext time they invest in new rolling
OL,10,Fstock.
OL,12,FDiana Johnson (Hull North & Cottingham)
OL,13,Fand Emma Hardy (Hull West &
OL,14,FHaltemprice) contacted First Hull
OL,15,FTrains and Northern Trains after
OL,16,FTransPennine Express' recent
OL,17,Fannouncement that it was investing #1bn
OL,18,Fin a new fleet of battery-electric
OL,19,Ftrains for the 2030s.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
