OL,3,GNEWSATrain firms urged by city's MPs to
OL,4,Ago all-electric
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said it would bring the East
OL,7,FYorkshire region in line with what is
OL,8,Fthe norm in the south-east of England.
OL,10,FIn response, Hull Trains said it was
OL,11,F"actively exploring" ways to "further
OL,12,Fdecarbonise" its operations.
